  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Sine is an odd function, so \\(\\sin(-90°)=-\\sin90°=-1\\).\n\nAlternative method 1: Locate the negative angle\n\nA negative angle turns clockwise, so a \\(90°\\) clockwise turn from the positive \\(x\\)-axis reaches the unit-circle point \\((0,-1)\\). Sine is the \\(y\\)-coordinate of this point, so \\(\\sin(-90°)=-1\\).",
